We need QAs to test next generation software solutions including responsive web sites and hybrid mobile applications. This is an excellent opportunity for ambitious and motivated candidates.
Pytek is one of the fastest growing companies on the Bulgarian IT market. Our goal is to recruit promising talented young people and invest in their professional development.
We have developed close professional connections with leading Bulgarian and international companies. More than fifty businesses from all over the world trust us with their IT projects.
We offer you:
• Positive working environment;
• Access to job assets and know-how;
• Payment based on achieved results;
• Professional development program;
• Access to big variety of projects;
• Continuous support and learning;
• Monthly feedback;
• A teammate always ready to help or share knowledge.
Job requirements:
• Bachelor’s degree in STEM fields;
• Basic understanding of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript;
• Analyzing the requirements from clients;
• Write test documentation such as test cases and scenarios;
• Defect Tracking;
• Conducting Review Meetings;
• Comfortable working directly with developers;
• Good understanding of Software Development Life Cycle;
• A natural problem solver;
• Verbal and written communication skills;
• Responsible, highly motivated and team oriented person;
• Attention to detail;
• Coachable and motivated;
• Time management.
The position is on site in our office in Sofia!
If this opportunity sounds appealing to you, apply now!
